{
    "pageid": 594,
    "title": "Better Looking Characters",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "BLC is a mod by Shaytana, also author of Lux Invicta , and is included standard in CK2Plus .  It adds new bits of everything and uses a lot of the base assets in creative ways including some of the Mongol DLC to redefine the way portraits are generated.  In addition its creator has added multiple culture-specific hats, armor, helmets and general clothing."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "After Shaytana's unexpected hiatus, richvh has taken over for both Lux Invicta and Better Looking Characters , keeping them updated for each version of CK2 released."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Gives individualized dna to most playable 1066 characters from Iceland to Georgia! (except mostly some nobles in HRE/France area).",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Better eye/hair color distribution throughout Europe. Northern blondes ahoy!",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Beards for Byzantines vs cleanshaven Normans, Saxon moustaches etc...",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Better looking random characters generated according to cultural rules.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Historical characters made to resemble their real selves where information is available.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Adds more realistic looking graphical cultures.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Adds regional/cultural clothes sets.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Implements a tiered martial system for characters in command.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Implements a 20 frames system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Integrated Little Portrait Mod by Peuri.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Integrated parts of Enhanced Portraits Mod courtesy of Trovador and thrashing mad.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Using parts of Crackdtoothgrin's Graphical Goodies P.S. He is awesome!",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "A BIG THANK YOU to Trashed who ported the dna from 8C to make it compatible with the new patch!",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
